ents with built-in loops. Lets developers run agents and track their changes at the function and class level while maintaining Git workflow integration.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-09\",\n    \"category\": \"IDE-integrated AI tools\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Tabstack\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/tabstack\",\n    \"description\": \"Browser automation tool for AI agents that reads accessibility trees instead of using screenshots, reducing token costs by 60-80%. Agents can automate web tasks like booking meetings or filling forms.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-09\",\n    \"category\": \"DevOps workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Auriko\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/auriko\",\n    \"description\": \"Trading desk API for LLM calls, allowing developers to optimize and manage API calls to large language models.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-09\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"agents-cli\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/agents-cli\",\n    \"description\": \"CLI tool specifically designed for AI coding agents to ship themselves from idea/demo to production. Provides scaffolding, evaluation, and deployment features tailored for AI agents like Gemini CLI, Claude Code, and Cursor.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-08\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"NanoKVM-Go\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/nanokvm-go\",\n    \"description\": \"Hardware/software solution that gives AI agents physical control over any screen, extending agent capabilities beyond the terminal.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-08\",\n    \"category\": \"DevOps workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"TryCase\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/trycase\",\n    \"description\": \"Disposable test environments specifically designed for AI coding agents. Provides isolated sandbox environments for testing AI-generated code.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-05\",\n    \"category\": \"Workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Tamamon\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/tamamon\",\n    \"description\": \"Desktop companion pet that grows as you code with Claude Code, gamifying the coding experience.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-03\",\n    \"category\": \"Workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  }\n]\n",
